  ('legacy:1290',1290,'Fastest households and NPISHs Final consumption expenditure per capita growth','World Bank','Economy · NE.CON.PRVT.PC.KD.ZG','verified','79','retain_exclusion','confirm_reasoned_exclusion','macro_or_landuse_curation_v16_2_6_final_curation','Potentially understandable after careful naming, but it sits in an already dense macro/land-use family and is not strong enough to clear the legacy block without comparing nearby alternatives. Final v16.2.6 curation decision: this concept is not selected for the playable core, so there is no reason to leave its legacy state unresolved.','Keep excluded for v16.2.6. A future release may explicitly reopen it, but the historical rejection is now backed by this current editorial curation decision.','',''),
